{
  "name": "@cgw/plugins",
  "version": "0.6.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Plugin blocks (INTEGRATIONS.md, Plugin blocks): the BlockDefinition interface, props read and merged so unknown props survive, the first-party chart and kanban over a database view, drawn into a plugin block's frame. Given a host; never saves, loads or calls the network.",
